    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/97ac5da696822216c3e1186c4372a53d.poster.avif?t=1753088967\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/97ac5da696822216c3e1186c4372a53d.webm?t=1753088967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/97ac5da696822216c3e1186c4372a53d.mp4?t=1753088967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Super reaKtor</strong> is a fast-paced Bullet Hell with original controls, where you must survive by collecting green energy pellets, and avoid or absorb various types of hostile TRI-SKL bullets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUT WHAT MAKES IT SPECIAL?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>THE CONTROLS</strong>: You can Move, Rotate, but also change the Size of your laser beam.<br></li><li><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong>: Your 2 weak points are located on each side of your laser beam. Your central beam can absorb hostile bullets !</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/31f11e4a17def23605bb48d032ab447d.poster.avif?t=1753088967\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/31f11e4a17def23605bb48d032ab447d.webm?t=1753088967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077190/extras/31f11e4a17def23605bb48d032ab447d.mp4?t=1753088967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>ARCADE MODES:</strong> 3 major game modes, over 300 hand crafted patterns across 5 levels<br></li><li> <strong>ONLINE LEADERBOARDS:</strong> Compete with the world and your friends<br></li><li> <strong>TRAINING MODE:</strong> Master the patterns in a safe zone<br></li><li> <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS:</strong> Collect them all<br></li><li> <strong>TRISKELS:</strong> A lot of them</li></ul>",
